# Site long cut (16:9): six scenes of 7 s (5 s of slow constant move, then 2 s to the next
# scene), repeated. Scenes: wide, close, turn (xw, yw), high angle, turn (xw, yw, zw), island.
# Shots are cut from inside the 5 s moves. The scripted player aims through the camera, so
# scout and render must use this file with the same --play: --warmup 10 --fps 30 --lane-snap
# --no-ui, 2560x1440. Times are recording time (game time minus the 10 s warm-up).
